From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: patch <patch@example.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add custom headers (User-Agent, x-device-os, x-hwid) to subscription settings

Adds three configurable HTTP headers to remote profile (subscription) settings:
  - User-Agent      : override the default HTTP User-Agent sent during updates
  - x-device-os     : custom OS identifier header
  - x-hwid          : hardware/device identifier header

Changes:
  1. database/TypedProfile.kt          — three new nullable String columns
  2. database/AppDatabase.kt           — Room migration v5 → v6
  3. bg/UpdateProfileWork.kt           — inject headers into OkHttp request
  4. ui/profile/EditProfileContentActivity.kt — UI fields for the three headers
  5. res/layout/activity_edit_profile_content.xml — TextInputLayouts
  6. res/values/strings.xml            — new string resources
---
 .../sfa/database/TypedProfile.kt                    |  18 +++-
 .../sfa/database/AppDatabase.kt                     |  21 +++-
 .../sfa/bg/UpdateProfileWork.kt                     |  28 ++++-
 .../ui/profile/EditProfileContentActivity.kt        |  60 ++++++++++-
 .../res/layout/activity_edit_profile_content.xml    |  78 ++++++++++++++
 .../main/res/values/strings.xml                     |   8 ++
 6 files changed, 207 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/src/main/java/io/nekohasekai/sfa/database/TypedProfile.kt b/app/src/main/java/io/nekohasekai/sfa/database/TypedProfile.kt
